  "id": "creamy-balsamic-vinaigrette",
  "name": "Creamy Balsamic Vinaigrette",
  "subtitle": "A smooth, tangy dressing for salads and vegetables",
  "description": "Blend balsamic vinegar, olive oil, mayonnaise, water, garlic, mustard, and brown sugar into a smooth dressing, then season to taste.",
